<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - UBS raises 3Dlabs.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - UBS raises 3Dlabs.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- UBS Securities said it upgraded 3Dlabs Inc Ltd to strong buy from buy, saying in a report the company is experiencing &quot;very strong&quot; demand for its products in the March quarter.</p>
<p>-- The stock was off 1-1/4 at 21-1/4.</p>
</text>
